# Mutanchor environment variables
#
# Mutanchor's CLI itself needs no environment variables (it takes everything
# on the command line). The ONE variable below is used by the RUNNER and the
# demo program's test suite to point a `cargo test` run at a freshly built
# mutant `.so` — you normally never set this by hand; `mutanchor run` sets it
# automatically for each mutant. Documented here so fresh clones know it
# exists.

# Path to a Solana Anchor program's compiled `.so` (BPF/SBF program binary),
# loaded by that program's LiteSVM test suite.
# MUTANCHOR_PROGRAM_SO=/path/to/program.so
